---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Karandeep Arora" description="How karandeeparora.com collects, uses and protects the information you share through the contact form.">
<Header />

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy<br>Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <h2>Information I collect</h2>
    <p>When you use the contact form on this site, I collect the details you submit: your name, email address, phone number (optional), the service you are interested in, and your message. I do not run user accounts or take payments on this site.</p>

    <h2>How I use it</h2>
    <p>I use this information only to reply to your enquiry, discuss your project and send a proposal if you ask for one. I do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing.</p>

    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are stored in a private content management system hosted on a server I control, and are accessible only to me and people I authorise to handle enquiries. Messages are kept for as long as needed to respond and for reasonable record-keeping, then deleted on request.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts and delivers this website and provides Turnstile, a spam-protection check on the contact form. Cloudflare may process technical data such as your IP address for security and performance.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the typefaces used on this site, which means your browser requests them from Google.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not set advertising or tracking cookies of its own. Cloudflare may set strictly necessary cookies for security.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask me at any time to see, correct or delete the information you have sent me. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and I will respond promptly.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If I change how I handle information, I will update this page and the date above.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal { max-width: 780px; }
.legal h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; margin: 36px 0 10px; }
.legal p, .legal li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
.legal ul { padding-left: 22px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.legal a { color: var(--olive); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
